# Documentation

Stale docs are a defect.

- Update architecture, REST, MCP, parity matrix, config, security, operations, and wave status when the change touches them.
- Update `AGENTS.md` if rules or layout change.
- Land user-visible changes under `CHANGELOG.md` `[Unreleased]`.
- Do not change an invariant without an ADR.
- Do not hand-edit generated OpenAPI, MCP manifests, or schemas.
- Internal links, examples, and command lines must remain accurate; `make test-docs` (once it exists) must pass.
